# Rust / Tauri build artifacts
src-tauri/target
src-tauri/gen
# Cargo.lock IS committed — the Cube is a binary app, not a library. Pinning
# the dependency set keeps CI reproducible and stops floating deps from
# silently breaking the build between sessions (they did: xcap/tauri drift,
# fixed 2026-07-15 when the Sentinel was armed).

# Bundled sidecar binaries — supplied at build time, never committed.
# The READMe in src-tauri/sidecars/ explains what to drop in.
src-tauri/sidecars/*
!src-tauri/sidecars/.gitkeep
!src-tauri/sidecars/README.md

# Tauri runtime caches (captured PNGs land here)
src-tauri/.cache
